§§ `For everyone`

-- Pt 2 of No. 1 of 2026 took effect on 13 May 2026: 2 June 2026 and 13 May 2026 are answered; 1 May 2026 is not.
#ASSERT `Does the deposited edition answer for the day I ask about` `as the young person` (Date 2 6 2026) EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Does the deposited edition answer for the day I ask about` `as the seller` (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Does the deposited edition answer for the day I ask about` `as the adult` (Date 13 5 2026) EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Does the deposited edition answer for the day I ask about` `as the young person` (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS `yes if` (`Does the deposited edition answer for` (Date 1 5 2026))

-- Glossary "prohibited product": a vape and an illicit tobacco product are; legal cigarettes are not.
#ASSERT `Is this item a prohibited product` `as the young person` `a vape` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is this item a prohibited product` `as the seller` `legal cigarettes` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Is this item a prohibited product` `as the adult` `illicit cigarettes` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is this item a prohibited product` `as the young person` `a therapeutic vape` EQUALS `yes if` (`Is it a prohibited product` `a therapeutic vape`)

§§ `For the young person under 18`

-- s 30B: one vape, within a personal use quantity of 2: no offence; five: s 30B(2); 60: s 30B(4); legal cigarettes: no
-- offence at all; before 13 May 2026: not answered.
#ASSERT `Is my possession of this item an offence` `as the young person` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2026` EQUALS `the answer is` `no offence: no more than the personal use quantity (s 30B(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of this item an offence` `as the young person` `five vapes at 16` EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 30B(2): more than the personal use quantity`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of this item an offence` `as the young person` `a commercial quantity of vapes` EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 30B(4): at least the commercial quantity`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of this item an offence` `as the young person` `a packet of legal cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `the answer is` `no offence: the Act makes no offence of possessing this`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of this item an offence` `as the young person` `Jake's vape, 2 June 2023` EQUALS `the answer is` `not answered: the day is before the deposited edition (13 May 2026)`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of this item an offence` `as the young person` `five vapes at 16` EQUALS `the answer is` (`Is my possession an offence` `five vapes at 16`)

-- Tier 4 penalty, first offence, individual: $600 000; s 30B(4)(a): $2 100 000; no offence: 0.
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for possessing this item` `as the young person` `five vapes at 16` EQUALS amount 600000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for possessing this item` `as the young person` `a commercial quantity of vapes` EQUALS amount 2100000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for possessing this item` `as the young person` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2026` EQUALS amount 0
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for possessing this item` `as the young person` `a commercial quantity of vapes` EQUALS amount (`What is the most I can be fined for my possession` `a commercial quantity of vapes`)

-- ss 6, 30A: legal cigarettes to a 16-year-old: s 6; a vape: s 30A only (not a tobacco product); illicit cigarettes: both.
#ASSERT `Was selling or supplying this item to me an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a packet of legal cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 6 (to a person under 18)`
#ASSERT `Was selling or supplying this item to me an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2026` EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 30A (a prohibited product, to anyone)`
#ASSERT `Was selling or supplying this item to me an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a packet of illicit cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under both s 6 and s 30A`
#ASSERT `Was selling or supplying this item to me an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a packet of illicit cigarettes at 16` EQUALS `the answer is` (`Was the supply to me an offence` `a packet of illicit cigarettes at 16`)

-- s 106: a look-alike, yes; a real vape is not a look-alike.
#ASSERT `Was selling me this look-alike an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a candy cigarette` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Was selling me this look-alike an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a vape` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Was selling me this look-alike an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a candy cigarette` EQUALS `yes if` (`Was selling me a look-alike an offence` `a candy cigarette`)

-- Tier 1 penalty: an individual's first offence $10 000; a company's second $100 000.
#ASSERT `What is the most the seller who sold to me can be fined under s 6` `as the young person` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most the seller who sold to me can be fined under s 6` `as the young person` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS amount 100000
#ASSERT `What is the most the seller who sold to me can be fined under s 6` `as the young person` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS amount (`What is the most the seller can be fined under s 6` TRUE FALSE)

