§§ `For the seller or supplier, and for a parent or other adult`

-- ss 6, 30A from the supplier's side.
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the seller` `legal cigarettes` (Date 2 6 2026) 16 FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 6 (to a person under 18)`
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the seller` `legal cigarettes` (Date 2 6 2026) 30 FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `no offence under this Act`
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the seller` `a vape` (Date 2 6 2026) 30 FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 30A (a prohibited product, to anyone)`
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the seller` `a therapeutic vape` (Date 2 6 2026) 30 TRUE EQUALS `the answer is` `no offence under this Act`
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the seller` `a vape` (Date 1 5 2026) 30 FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `not answered: the day is before the deposited edition (13 May 2026)`
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the seller` `a pipe` (Date 2 6 2026) 17 FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 6 (to a person under 18)`
-- A parent giving their 16-year-old a cigarette supplies it (Glossary "supply"): s 6. A vape to a 17-year-old: s 30A.
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the adult` `legal cigarettes` (Date 2 6 2026) 16 FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 6 (to a person under 18)`
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the adult` `a vape` (Date 2 6 2026) 17 FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `an offence under s 30A (a prohibited product, to anyone)`
-- Mirror: the young person's question on the same facts.
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the seller` `legal cigarettes` (Date 2 6 2026) 16 FALSE EQUALS `Was selling or supplying this item to me an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a packet of legal cigarettes at 16`
#ASSERT `Would it be an offence for me to sell or supply this item to this person` `as the adult` `illicit cigarettes` (Date 2 6 2026) 16 FALSE EQUALS `Was selling or supplying this item to me an offence` `as the young person` TRUE `a packet of illicit cigarettes at 16`

§§ `For the seller or supplier`

-- Tier 1 penalty.
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for selling tobacco to someone under 18` `as the seller` FALSE FALSE EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for selling tobacco to someone under 18` `as the seller` TRUE FALSE EQUALS amount 50000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for selling tobacco to someone under 18` `as the seller` FALSE TRUE EQUALS amount 20000

-- s 106.
#ASSERT `Is it an offence for me to sell this look-alike` `as the seller` `a candy cigarette` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is it an offence for me to sell this look-alike` `as the seller` `a lighter` EQUALS no

-- s 12: tobacco and implements; not a lighter.
#ASSERT `May I refuse to sell this item without proof of age` `as the seller` `a pipe` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I refuse to sell this item without proof of age` `as the seller` `a lighter` EQUALS no

-- s 15(1): a current licence with photo and date of birth: yes; an expired one: no.
#ASSERT `Is this document proof that the buyer has reached 18` `as the seller` `a current Australian driver's licence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is this document proof that the buyer has reached 18` `as the seller` `an expired passport or licence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Is this document proof that the buyer has reached 18` `as the seller` `a current passport` TRUE FALSE EQUALS no

-- s 13(2): a 15-year-old with a passport saying 18, signs up: the defence; no signs: none.
#ASSERT `Do I have the s 13 defence` `as the seller` TRUE TRUE 15 TRUE TRUE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Do I have the s 13 defence` `as the seller` TRUE TRUE 15 TRUE FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Do I have the s 13 defence` `as the seller` TRUE FALSE 17 TRUE TRUE EQUALS no
-- Mirror: the young person's question on the same facts.
#ASSERT `Do I have the s 13 defence` `as the seller` TRUE TRUE 15 TRUE TRUE EQUALS `Does the seller who sold me tobacco have the s 13 defence` `as the young person` TRUE TRUE 15 TRUE TRUE

§§ `For a parent or other adult`

-- ss 7, 30A, in the adult's words.
#ASSERT `Would I commit an offence by buying this item for the young person` `as the adult` `legal cigarettes` 16 EQUALS `the answer is` "s 7"
#ASSERT `Would I commit an offence by buying this item for the young person` `as the adult` `illicit cigarettes` 15 EQUALS `the answer is` "s 7 and s 30A"
#ASSERT `Would I commit an offence by buying this item for the young person` `as the adult` `a vape` 16 EQUALS `the answer is` "s 30A, by supplying it to the young person"
#ASSERT `Would I commit an offence by buying this item for the young person` `as the adult` `a therapeutic vape` 16 EQUALS `the answer is` "no offence under this Act"
#ASSERT `Would I commit an offence by buying this item for the young person` `as the adult` `a lighter` 16 EQUALS `the answer is` "no offence under this Act"
